# Sprint 16+: a real google-services.json (with real project_number + api_key)
# must NEVER be committed. The tracked placeholder at
# android/app/google-services.json lets the com.google.gms.google-services
# Gradle plugin parse the file at build time so the APK still assembles.
# When dropping a REAL Firebase config locally in Sprint 19, rename it to
# google-services.local.json and configure Gradle to prefer it. See
# sprint-16-native-plugin-pattern.md §3.
android/app/google-services.local.json

# Sprint 16+: Sentry symbolication artifacts. Rebuilt every release;
# uploaded via scripts/upload-symbols (Sprint 19). Never committed.
# Architect ref: sprint-16-native-plugin-pattern.md §6.
android/app/build/outputs/mapping/
ios/build/**/dSYMs/
*.dSYM/
*.dSYM.zip
